OL,3,GNEWSAWeather-damaged Liver Bird removed
OL,4,Afor restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Liverpool's oldest Liver Birds
OL,7,Fhas been removed from the Mersey
OL,8,FChambers building for restoration work.
OL,10,FThe Victorian statue, believed to
OL,11,Fpre-date the two Liver Birds on the
OL,12,FRoyal Liver Building, is a feature on
OL,13,Fthe building in Old Churchyard.
OL,15,FKnown as the "Third Liver Bird" or the
OL,16,F"Mother Bird" it overlooks the
OL,17,Fchurchyard of nearby Liverpool Parish
OL,18,FChurch and the River Mersey.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
