OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWeather-damaged Liver Bird removed
OL,4,Afor restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanny Keating from Acorn Insurance,
OL,7,Fwhich has owned the Grade II listed
OL,8,FMersey Chambers building since 2016,
OL,9,Fsaid the statue had been damaged by
OL,10,Fweather and would return once it had
OL,11,Fbeen restored "to its former glory".
